n\\nI need to deliver a concise answer and confirm with the user before proceeding. It looks like the user wants to permanently add a model in their Cursor settings, but since they're on a Linux VM, I can’t directly access their Mac to change Cursor settings.\\n\\nI should state that I can’t operate their browser from here unless they provide access. However, I can suggest exact model names and steps. I’ll also consider checking the local Cursor config if synced, although the details about operating systems might complicate things.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Determining SiliconFlow Models**\\n\\nIt seems that the documentation only specifies adding model names without giving a complete list. I’m thinking it would be wise to ask the user which specific SiliconFlow model(s) they want to use long-term. Alternatively, I could recommend a set of models they might find useful.\\n\\nPerhaps I should also check the Cursor configuration format from other documentation sources as it may help me provide better guidance. I want to ensure my conclusions are clear and safe for the user.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 结论先说：**这篇文档本身没有给出具体模型清单**，它只说明了在 Cursor 里长期接入 SiliconFlow 的方法——到 **Settings → Models** 里手动添加模型名、打开开关，然后填 **API Base URL + API Key** 做验证。\n\n你这个需求我能继续做，但现在有两个现实问题：\n\n1. **我当前不在你的 macOS 本机上**，没法直接改你本地的 Cursor 配置。  \n2. 你刚发了 **明文 API Key**，这是敏感信息。**不要再继续在聊天里发第二次。建议你立刻去 SiliconFlow 后台把这把 key 删除并重建。**\n\n你如果要我“长期配置好”，给我二选一：\n\n### 方案 A：我给你一份可直接照抄的配置清单\n你自己 1 分钟手动配完。  \n需要填的是：\n\n- **API Base URL**：`https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1`\n- **API Key**：你新的那把 key\n- **Model Names**：你要长期用的模型名\n\n如果你让我直接给推荐，我建议先长期保留这几个常用档：\n\n- `Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct`\n- `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3`\n- `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1`\n\n### 方案 B：我帮你落到本机配置\n前提是你给我**可操作你本机 Cursor 的方式**，比如：\n- 给我 **Cursor 配置文件路径**，我帮你改\n- 或者你把 **OpenClaw Browser Relay** 挂到你本机浏览器，我直接带你点完\n- 或者把你本机相关配置文件内容贴给我，我帮你生成最终版本\n\n**建议下一步：**\n1. 先**废弃刚才那把 key 并新建一把**\n2. 回我一句：  \n   - **“给我推荐长期模型组合”**  \n   或  \n   - **“我让你直接配，配置路径是 xxx”**\n\n你要是愿意，我下一条直接给你一套 **适合长期在 Cursor 用的 SiliconFlow 模型组合**，按 **代码 / 通用 / 推理** 三档配好。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b55cdc22048191b24232877b03ac0e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":13344,"output":778,"cacheRead":6656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20778,"cost":{"input":0.03336,"output":0.01167,"cacheRead":0.001664,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.046694}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773493451527}}
{"type":"message","id":"61191028","parentId":"a3c9ab1c","timestamp":"2026-03-14T13:11:27.333Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5461a92a38a0b49126eb7f2f509\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 21:11 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5461a92a38a0b49126eb7f2f509]\n范: https://docs.siliconflow.cn/cn/usercases/use-siliconcloud-in-OpenClaw\n增加这里面的模型为我长期使用\n我的key是sk-kcayvhpneyjwvhaywkuhdnrjzsiirizrqilusyosbfwpfiur"}],"timestamp":1773493887329}}
