{"type":"message","id":"15d2757a","parentId":"f883d357","timestamp":"2026-03-14T13:18:39.482Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 搞定了。现在 **GLM-4.6 已删除**，你要的 6 个 SiliconFlow 模型已经加进长期配置，并且我验证过 `openclaw models list` 能正常识别。\n\n已加入的模型：\n\n- `siliconflow/Pro/moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5`\n- `siliconflow/Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5`\n- `siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5`\n- `siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-4.7`\n- `siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B`\n- `siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2`\n\n你之后可以直接这样切：\n```bash\n/model siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\n```\n\n再提醒一句硬话：**你这把 SiliconFlow key 已经暴露在聊天里了，别拖，马上去重置。**  \n如果你愿意，我下一步可以继续帮你做两件事之一：\n\n1. **把默认模型切到其中一个 SiliconFlow 模型**\n2. **把这 6 个模型按用途分组，给你一套“日常默认 / 写代码 / 深度推理”推荐方案**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b5602a0b7481919bcee69168d205d9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":405,"output":294,"cacheRead":41728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42427,"cost":{"input":0.0010125000000000002,"output":0.00441,"cacheRead":0.010432,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0158545}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773494313117}}
{"type":"message","id":"66f39ae0","parentId":"15d2757a","timestamp":"2026-03-14T13:33:35.177Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5462742ccca0b348c9ea07112b1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 21:33 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5462742ccca0b348c9ea07112b1]\n范: 把这 6 个模型按用途分组，给我一套“日常默认 / 写代码 / 深度推理”推荐方案"}],"timestamp":1773495215170}}
{"type":"message","id":"d17fc947","parentId":"66f39ae0","timestamp":"2026-03-14T13:33:51.672Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 直接给你结论，按你现在这 6 个模型，我建议这样分：\n\n## 推荐分组\n\n### 1) 日常默认\n**`siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2`**\n\n适合：\n- 日常问答\n- 写方案\n- 改文案\n- 常规技术讨论\n- 大多数不中不重的任务\n\n原因：\n- 综合能力最均衡\n- 稳，通用性强\n- 当默认模型最省心\n\n---\n\n### 2) 写代码\n**`siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B`**\n\n适合：\n- 写代码\n- 改 bug\n- 解释报错\n- 生成脚本\n- 重构小中型模块\n- API / 配置 / 工程类问题\n\n原因：\n- 代码理解和生成更对路\n- 对工程类上下文通常更顺手\n- 拿来做开发助手更合适\n\n---\n\n### 3) 深度推理\n**`siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5`**\n\n适合：\n- 复杂分析\n- 多步骤规划\n- 难题拆解\n- 长链路判断\n- 需要“先想清楚再回答”的任务\n\n原因：\n- 更适合吃复杂任务\n- 做深度推理比当日常默认更值\n- 用在关键问题上更划算\n\n---\n\n## 另外 3 个模型怎么定位\n\n### `siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-4.7`\n定位：\n- **GLM-5 的次选**\n- 当你想要 GLM 风格，但不一定上最重模型时用\n\n### `siliconflow/Pro/moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5`\n定位：\n- **长文本处理 / 中文表达 / 内容整理**\n- 适合资料归纳、文章辅助、长上下文对话\n\n### `siliconflow/Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5`\n定位：\n- **创意表达 / 对话体验 / 备选通用模型**\n- 当你想换个回答风格，或者做内容 brainstorming 时可以上\n\n---\n\n## 最终推荐方案\n\n### 你的主力三件套\n- **日常默认**：`siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2`\n- **写代码**：`siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B`\n- **深度推理**：`siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5`\n\n---\n\n## 使用建议\n\n你平时就按这个思路切：\n\n- **不确定用什么** → `DeepSeek-V3.2`\n- **要写代码/排错** → `Qwen3.5`\n- **要做复杂判断/深度分析** → `GLM-5`\n\n---\n\n## 一句话版本\n我建议你长期这么用：\n\n- **默认主力**：DeepSeek-V3.2\n- **开发主力**：Qwen3.5\n- **思考主力**：GLM-5\n\n如果你点头，我下一步可以直接继续帮你做：\n**把 OpenClaw 默认模型切到 `DeepSeek-V3.2`，并顺手给你配一套 fallbacks。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b563b1a968819190c6933ba6002d1c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":40440,"output":739,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42715,"cost":{"input":0.10110000000000001,"output":0.011085000000000001,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.112569}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773495215173}}
{"type":"message","id":"b7adbc90","parentId":"d17fc947","timestamp":"2026-03-14T13:40:42.507Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54621b556ca4b4b9ff874f2acd9\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 21:40 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54621b556ca4b4b9ff874f2acd9]\n范: 按你的方案继续，然后给我看看你是怎么设置的"}],"timestamp":1773495642500}}
