irms that it's been verified. This way, I’m keeping things secure and focused. By sticking to the necessary information, I can help ensure that sensitive data stays protected and only what’s needed gets shared. It’s all about being responsible with the information at hand.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已按方案继续，**默认模型已经切到 `DeepSeek-V3.2`**，并且我加了 fallback 链路。刚验证过，当前默认生效的是：\n\n```bash\nsiliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2\n```\n\n### 我是这样设置的\n\n#### 1) 默认模型\n```json\n\"agents\": {\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"model\": {\n      \"primary\": \"siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n      \"fallbacks\": [\n        \"siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B\",\n        \"siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\",\n        \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2) SiliconFlow provider\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"siliconflow\": {\n      \"baseUrl\": \"https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1\",\n      \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n      \"models\": [\n        { \"id\": \"Pro/moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5\", \"name\": \"Kimi 2.5\" },\n        { \"id\": \"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5\", \"name\": \"MiniMax M2.5\" },\n        { \"id\": \"Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\", \"name\": \"GLM-5\" },\n        { \"id\": \"Pro/zai-org/GLM-4.7\", \"name\": \"GLM-4.7\" },\n        { \"id\": \"Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B\", \"name\": \"Qwen 3.5\" },\n        { \"id\": \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2\", \"name\": \"DeepSeek V3.2\" }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 3) 长期可用模型列表\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/Pro/moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-4.7\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B\": {},\n  \"siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {}\n}\n```\n\n### 这套逻辑怎么理解\n- **primary**：日常默认走 `DeepSeek-V3.2`\n- **fallback 1**：如果默认模型不可用，退到 `Qwen3.5`\n- **fallback 2**：再退到 `GLM-5`\n- **fallback 3**：最后退到你原来的 `gpt-5.4`\n\n### 你后面怎么用\n临时切模型：\n```bash\n/model siliconflow/Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B\n```\n\n看当前模型：\n```bash\n/status\n```\n\n再提醒一次：**你那把 SiliconFlow key 已经暴露过，尽快换掉。**  \n你要的话，我下一步可以继续帮你两件事：\n\n1. **把 fallback 顺序再调优**\n2. **把新 key 替换进配置，并把旧 key 清掉**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b565705ee881919cf0a9cd06539fc7\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2674,"output":805,"cacheRead":43648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47127,"cost":{"input":0.006685000000000001,"output":0.012075,"cacheRead":0.010912,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029672000000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773495661238}}
