/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:153:  YES -> Use cron (isolated) with --model/--thinking\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:154:  NO  -> Use heartbeat\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:161:1. **Heartbeat** handles routine monitoring (inbox, calendar, notifications) in one batched turn every 30 minutes.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:162:2. **Cron** handles precise schedules (daily reports, weekly reviews) and one-shot reminders.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:166:**HEARTBEAT.md** (checked every 30 min):\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:169:# Heartbeat checklist\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:177:**Cron jobs** (precise timing):\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:181:openclaw cron add --name \"Morning brief\" --cron \"0 7 * * *\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --announce\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:184:openclaw cron add --name \"Weekly review\" --cron \"0 9 * * 1\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --model opus\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:187:openclaw cron add --name \"Call back\" --at \"2h\" --session main --system-event \"Call back the client\" --wake now\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:201:### How it pairs with heartbeat and cron\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:203:- **Heartbeat/cron** decide _when_ a run happens.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:206:For scheduled workflows, use cron or heartbeat to trigger an agent turn that calls Lobster.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:220:Both heartbeat and cron can interact with the main session, but differently:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.