ess@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:3292:模板占位符在 `tools.media.*.models[].args` 和 `tools.media.models[].args`（以及未来任何模板化参数字段）中展开。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:3317:## Cron（Gateway 网关调度器）\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:3319:Cron 是 Gateway 网关自有的唤醒和定时任务调度器。参见 [Cron 任务](/automation/cron-jobs) 了解功能概述和 CLI 示例。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:3323:  cron: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:4:  - 在心跳和 cron 之间选择定时任务方案时\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:9:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:12:  source_path: gateway/heartbeat.md\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:18:> **心跳 vs Cron？** 参见 [Cron vs 心跳](/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat) 了解何时使用哪种方案。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:25:2. 在智能体工作区创建一个简单的 `HEARTBEAT.md` 检查清单（可选但推荐）。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:36:      heartbeat: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:49:- 间隔：`30m`（当检测到的认证模式为 Anthropic OAuth/setup-token 时为 `1h`）。设置 `agents.defaults.heartbeat.every` 或单智能体 `agents.list[].heartbeat.every`；使用 `0m` 禁用。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:50:- 提示内容（可通过 `agents.defaults.heartbeat.prompt` 配置）：\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:51:  `Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.`\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:52:- 心跳提示**原样**作为用户消息发送。系统提示包含\"Heartbeat\"部分，运行在内部被标记。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:53:- 活动时段（`heartbeat.activeHours`）按配置的时区检查。在时段外，心跳会被跳过直到下一个时段内的时钟周期。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:62:如果你希望心跳执行非常具体的任务（例如\"检查 Gmail PubSub 统计\"或\"验证 Gateway 网关健康状态\"），将 `agents.defaults.heartbeat.prompt`（或 `agents.list[].heartbeat.prompt`）设置为自定义内容（原样发送）。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:66:- 如果没有需要关注的事项，回复 **`HEARTBEAT_OK`**。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:67:- 在心跳运行期间，当 `HEARTBEAT_OK` 出现在回复的**开头或结尾**时，OpenClaw 将其视为确认。该标记会被移除，如果剩余内容 **≤ `ackMaxChars`**（默认：300），则回复被丢弃。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:68:- 如果 `HEARTBEAT_OK` 出现在回复的**中间**，则不会被特殊处理。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:69:- 对于警报，**不要**包含 `HEARTBEAT_OK`；只返回警报文本。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:71:在心跳之外，消息开头/结尾的意外 `HEARTBEAT_OK` 会被移除并记录日志；仅包含 `HEARTBEAT_OK` 的消息会被丢弃。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:79:      heartbeat: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:81:        model: \"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5\",\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:85:        prompt: \"Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\",\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:86:        ackMaxChars: 300, // HEARTBEAT_OK 后允许的最大字符数\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:95:- `agents.defaults.heartbeat` 设置全局心跳行为。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:96:- `agents.list[].heartbeat` 在其之上合并；如果任何智能体有 `heartbeat` 块，**只有这些智能体**运行心跳。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:97:- `channels.defaults.heartbeat` 为所有渠道设置可见性默认值。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:98:- `channels.<channel>.heartbeat` 覆盖渠道默认值。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:99:- `channels.<channel>.accounts.<id>.heartbeat`（多账户渠道）覆盖单渠道设置。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:103:如果任何 `agents.list[]` 条目包含 `heartbeat` 块，**只有这些智能体**运行心跳。单智能体块在 `agents.defaults.heartbeat` 之上合并（因此你可以设置一次共享默认值，然后按智能体覆盖）。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:111:      heartbeat: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:120:        heartbeat: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:124:          prompt: \"Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\",\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:135:- `model`：心跳运行的可选模型覆盖（`provider/model`）。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:147:- `ackMaxChars`：`HEARTBEAT_OK` 后在发送前允许的最大字符数。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:160:默认情况下，`HEARTBEAT_OK` 确认会被抑制，而警报内容会被发送。你可以按渠道或按账户调整：\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:165:    heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:166:      showOk: false # 隐藏 HEARTBEAT_OK（默认）\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:170:    heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:175:        heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:183:- `showOk`：当模型返回仅 OK 的回复时，发送 `HEARTBEAT_OK` 确认。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:194:    heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:199:    heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:203:        heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:206:    heartbeat:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:215:| 完全静默（无消息，无指示器）  | `channels.defaults.heartbeat: { showOk: false, showAlerts: false, useIndicator: false }` |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:216:| 仅指示器（无消息）            | `channels.defaults.heartbeat: { showOk: false, showAlerts: false, useIndicator: true }`  |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:217:| 仅在一个渠道显示 OK           | `channels.telegram.heartbeat: { showOk: true }`                                          |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:219:## HEARTBEAT.md（可选）\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:221:如果工作区中存在 `HEARTBEAT.md` 文件，默认提示会告诉智能体读取它。把它想象成你的\"心跳检查清单\"：小巧、稳定，可以安全地每 30 分钟包含一次。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:223:如果 `HEARTBEAT.md` 存在但实际上是空的（只有空行和 markdown 标题如 `# Heading`），OpenClaw 会跳过心跳运行以节省 API 调用。如果文件不存在，心跳仍会运行，由模型决定做什么。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:227:`HEARTBEAT.md` 示例：\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:230:# Heartbeat checklist\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:237:### 智能体可以更新 HEARTBEAT.md 吗？\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:241:`HEARTBEAT.md` 只是智能体工作区中的普通文件，所以你可以在普通聊天中告诉智能体：\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:243:- \"更新 `HEARTBEAT.md` 添加每日日历检查。\"\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:244:- \"重写 `HEARTBEAT.md`，使其更短并专注于收件箱跟进。\"\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:246:如果你希望这主动发生，你也可以在心跳提示中包含明确的一行，如：\"If the checklist becomes stale, update HEARTBEAT.md with a better one.\"\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:248:安全提示：不要在 `HEARTBEAT.md` 中放置密钥（API 密钥、电话号码、私有令牌）— 它会成为提示上下文的一部分。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:258:如果多个智能体配置了 `heartbeat`，手动唤醒会立即运行每个智能体的心跳。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:260:使用 `--mode next-heartbeat` 等待下一个计划的时钟周期。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:268:- `agents.defaults.heartbeat.includeReasoning: true`\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/heartbeat.md:274:心跳运行完整的智能体轮次。更短的间隔消耗更多 token。保持 `HEARTBEAT.md` 小巧，如果你只想要内部状态更新，考虑使用更便宜的 `model` 或 `target: \"none\"`。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:10:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:45:    model: { primary: \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5\" },\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:142:        models: [\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:143:          { provider: \"openai\", model: \"gpt-4o-mini-transcribe\" },\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:145:          // { type: \"cli\", command: \"whisper\", args: [\"--model\", \"base\", \"{{MediaPath}}\"] }\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:152:        models: [{ 