zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:558:  models: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:565:        models: [\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/onboarding-config-protocol.md:7:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:5:summary: 加固 cron.add 输入处理，对齐 schema，改进 cron UI/智能体工具\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:6:title: Cron Add 加固\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:9:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:12:  source_path: experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:16:# Cron Add 加固 & Schema 对齐\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:20:最近的 Gateway 网关日志显示重复的 `cron.add` 失败，参数无效（缺少 `sessionTarget`、`wakeMode`、`payload`，以及格式错误的 `schedule`）。这表明至少有一个客户端（可能是智能体工具调用路径）正在发送包装的或部分指定的任务负载。另外，TypeScript 中的 cron 提供商枚举、Gateway 网关 schema、CLI 标志和 UI\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:24:- 通过规范化常见的包装负载并推断缺失的 `kind` 字段来停止 `cron.add` INVALID_REQUEST 垃圾。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:25:- 在 Gateway 网关 schema、cron 类型、CLI 文档和 UI 表单之间对齐 cron 提供商列表。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:26:- 使智能体 cron 工具 schema 明确，以便 LLM 生成正确的任务负载。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:27:- 修复 Control UI cron 状态任务计数显示。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:32:- 更改 cron 调度语义或任务执行行为。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:33:- 添加新的调度类型或 cron 表达式解析。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:34:- 除了必要的字段修复外，不大改 cron 的 UI/UX。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:38:- Gateway 网关中的 `CronPayloadSchema` 排除了 `signal` + `imessage`，而 TS 类型包含它们。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:39:- Control UI CronStatus 期望 `jobCount`，但 Gateway 网关返回 `jobs`。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:40:- 智能体 cron 工具 schema 允许任意 `job` 对象，导致格式错误的输入。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:41:- Gateway 网关严格验证 `cron.add` 而不进行规范化，因此包装的负载会失败。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:45:- `cron.add` 和 `cron.update` 现在规范化常见的包装形式并推断缺失的 `kind` 字段。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:46:- 智能体 cron 工具 schema 与 Gateway 网关 schema 匹配，减少无效负载。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:56:参见 [Cron 任务](/automation/cron-jobs) 了解规范化的形式和示例。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:60:- 观察 Gateway 网关日志中 `cron.add` INVALID_REQUEST 错误是否减少。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:61:- 确认 Control UI cron 状态在刷新后显示任务计数。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:65:- 手动 Control UI 冒烟测试：为每个提供商添加一个 cron 任务 + 验证状态任务计数。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/plans/cron-add-hardening.md:69:- `cron.add` 是否应该接受来自客户端的显式 `state`（当前被 schema 禁止）？\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:8:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:11:  source_path: experiments/proposals/model-config.md\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:19:- [模型](/concepts/models)\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:20:- [模型故障转移](/concepts/model-failover)\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:28:- 简单的 `/model` 选择，并具有可预测的回退行为。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/experiments/proposals/model-config.md:33:- 保持模型选择简洁：`provider/model` 加可选别名。\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/refactor/strict-config.md:10:  model: claude-opus-4-5\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:2:summary: \"Guidance for choosing between heartbeat and cron jobs for automation\"\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:7:title: \"Cron vs Heartbeat\"\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:10:# Cron vs Heartbeat: When to Use Each\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:12:Both heartbeats and cron jobs let you run tasks on a schedule. This guide helps you choose the right mechanism for your use case.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:18:| Check inbox every 30 min             | Heartbeat           | Batches with other checks, context-aware |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:19:| Send daily report at 9am sharp       | Cron (isolated)     | Exact timing needed                      |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:20:| Monitor calendar for upcoming events | Heartbeat           | Natural fit for periodic awareness       |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:21:| Run weekly deep analysis             | Cron (isolated)     | Standalone task, can use different model |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:22:| Remind me in 20 minutes              | Cron (main, `--at`) | One-shot with precise timing             |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:23:| Background project health check      | Heartbeat           | Piggybacks on existing cycle             |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:25:## Heartbeat: Periodic Awareness\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:27:Heartbeats run in the **main session** at a regular interval (default: 30 min). They're designed for the agent to check on things and surface anything important.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:29:### When to use heartbeat\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:31:- **Multiple periodic checks**: Instead of 5 separate cron jobs checking inbox, calendar, weather, notifications, and project status, a single heartbeat can batch all of these.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:33:- **Conversational continuity**: Heartbeat runs share the same session, so the agent remembers recent conversations and can follow up naturally.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:34:- **Low-overhead monitoring**: One heartbeat replaces many small polling tasks.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:36:### Heartbeat advantages\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:39:- **Reduces API calls**: A single heartbeat is cheaper than 5 isolated cron jobs.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:41:- **Smart suppression**: If nothing needs attention, the agent replies `HEARTBEAT_OK` and no message is delivered.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:44:### Heartbeat example: HEARTBEAT.md checklist\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:47:# Heartbeat checklist\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:55:The agent reads this on each heartbeat and handles all items in one turn.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:57:### Configuring heartbeat\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:63:      heartbeat: {\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:73:See [Heartbeat](/gateway/heartbeat) for full configuration.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:75:## Cron: Precise Scheduling\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:77:Cron jobs run at precise times and can run in isolated sessions without affecting main context.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:81:### When to use cron\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:85:- **Different model/thinking**: Heavy analysis that warrants a more powerful model.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:90:### Cron advantages\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:92:- **Precise timing**: 5-field or 6-field (seconds) cron expressions with timezone support.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:95:- **Session isolation**: Runs in `cron:<jobId>` without polluting main history.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:96:- **Model overrides**: Use a cheaper or more powerful model per job.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:98:- **Immediate delivery**: Announce mode posts directly without waiting for heartbeat.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:102:### Cron example: Daily morning briefing\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:105:openclaw cron add \\\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:107:  --cron \"0 7 * * *\" \\\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:111:  --model opus \\\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:119:### Cron example: One-shot reminder\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:122:openclaw cron add \\\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:131:See [Cron jobs](/automation/cron-jobs) for full CLI reference.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:137:  YES -> Use cron\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:141:  YES -> Use cron (isolated)\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:145:  YES -> Use heartbeat (add to HEARTBEAT.md)\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:146:  NO  -> Use cron\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:149:  YES -> Use cron with --at\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:152:Does it need a different model or thinking level?\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:153:  YES -> Use cron (isolated) with --model/--thinking\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:154:  NO  -> Use heartbeat\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:161:1. **Heartbeat** handles routine monitoring (inbox, calendar, notifications) in one batched turn every 30 minutes.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:162:2. **Cron** handles precise schedules (daily reports, weekly reviews) and one-shot reminders.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:166:**HEARTBEAT.md** (checked every 30 min):\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:169:# Heartbeat checklist\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:177:**Cron jobs** (precise timing):\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:181:openclaw cron add --name \"Morning brief\" --cron \"0 7 * * *\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --announce\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:184:openclaw cron add --name \"Weekly review\" --cron \"0 9 * * 1\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --model opus\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:187:openclaw cron add --name \"Call back\" --at \"2h\" --session main --system-event \"Call back the client\" --wake now\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:201:### How it pairs with heartbeat and cron\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:203:- **Heartbeat/cron** decide _when_ a run happens.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:206:For scheduled workflows, use cron or heartbeat to trigger an agent turn that calls Lobster.\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:220:Both heartbeat and cron can interact with the main session, but differently:\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:222:|         | Heartbeat                       | Cron (main)              | Cron (isolated)            |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:224:| Session | Main                            | Main (via system event)  | `cron:<jobId>`             |\nFILE /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.96_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.7_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:227:| Model   | Main session model              | Main session model       | Can override               |\