{"type":"message","id":"6b104a42","parentId":"1f2cc2b2","timestamp":"2026-03-14T14:09:27.933Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已改好，现在是你要的这套：\n\n### 默认模型链路\n- **primary**：`openai-codex/gpt-5.4`\n- **fallback 1**：`siliconflow/Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5`\n- **fallback 2**：`siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5`\n- **fallback 3**：`arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n\n### heartbeat 默认模型\n- `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n\n### 我实际写入的是\n```json\n\"model\": {\n  \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\",\n  \"fallbacks\": [\n    \"siliconflow/Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5\",\n    \"siliconflow/Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\",\n    \"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2\"\n  ]\n},\n\"heartbeat\": {\n  \"model\": \"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2\"\n}\n```\n\n### 说明\n你消息里写的是 `arkcode/DeepSeek V3.2`，但配置里必须用 **模型 ID**，所以正确写法是：\n```bash\narkcode/deepseek-v3.2\n```\n\n当前默认模型我也验证了，还是：\n```bash\nopenai-codex/gpt-5.4\n```\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你把 **arkcode 里其它模型也加入 fallback 备选策略**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b56c119ca88191a75d15556eaba77c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2692,"output":341,"cacheRead":155264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":158297,"cost":{"input":0.006730000000000001,"output":0.005115,"cacheRead":0.038815999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.050661}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773497360407}}
{"type":"message","id":"d264a4e8","parentId":"6b104a42","timestamp":"2026-03-14T14:30:16.085Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b546341a0d8a0b3884bfa8bc333b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 22:30 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b546341a0d8a0b3884bfa8bc333b]\n范: /skills"}],"timestamp":1773498616038}}
