r a description of the skills I command. Since they sent a slash command in the chat, it seems like they might want a list of available skills. I should explain what skills I have installed. Maybe I should clarify what each skill does, but I wonder if there's a need for tools right now? It’s important to be helpful and provide the right information!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 当前你这边可用的主要 skills 有这些：\n\n- **feishu-doc**：飞书文档读写\n- **feishu-drive**：飞书云盘/文件夹管理\n- **feishu-perm**：飞书权限/协作者\n- **feishu-wiki**：飞书知识库\n- **clawhub**：公共技能仓库管理\n- **github**：GitHub CLI 操作\n- **healthcheck**：主机安全检查/加固\n- **obsidian**：Obsidian 笔记库\n- **skill-creator**：创建/整理/审查 skills\n- **summarize**：总结 URL、PDF、音视频\n- **tmux**：远程控制 tmux\n- **video-frames**：提取视频帧\n- **weather**：天气\n- **Agent Browser**：浏览器自动化\n- **find-skills**：查找适合安装的 skill\n- **tavily**：AI 搜索\n- **tencent-cloud-cos**：腾讯云 COS / CI\n- **tencent-docs**：腾讯文档\n- **tencentcloud-lighthouse-skill**：腾讯云 Lighthouse\n\n如果你是想要 **像命令行 `/skills` 那样看得更细**，我也可以下一条直接给你分成：\n\n1. **已安装可直接用**\n2. **适合你当前工作流的推荐 skill**\n3. **如果你要新增能力，应该装什么**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b57101ce508191bc057364708b49f2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":158584,"output":390,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":158974,"cost":{"input":0.39646000000000003,"output":0.00585,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.40231000000000006}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773498616048}}
