":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"I can't modify the operator policy directly, as the user is asking for that. It's important for me to state that I have to follow the established guidelines and can't ignore them. However, I can offer guidance on how they might be able to change it on their own. Maybe I can help with updating the configuration documents if they want to know where to make those changes. No tools are needed for this.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以改，但**我不能在当前会话里擅自绕过已经生效的 operator policy**。  \n也就是说：**只要这条策略还是当前上层规则，我这里执行搜索时就必须先走 `skillhub`，不能直接改成默认走 `clawhub`。**\n\n你要的是这类改法：\n\n### 你想要的新流程\n1. **搜索**：直接 `clawhub`\n2. **如果 clawhub 不可用/没结果**：再决定是否 fallback\n3. **不再优先 `skillhub`**\n\n### 我能帮你的两种方式\n#### 方案 A：你直接改 operator policy 文案\n把现在这段：\n\n- For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n- If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n\n改成类似这样：\n\n- For skills discovery/install/update, try `clawhub` first (public-registry).\n- If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `skillhub` (cn-optimized).\n- For search requests, execute `exec` with `clawhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n\n#### 方案 B：你让我帮你整理成一版完整的新 policy 文案\n我直接给你一份可替换版本，你复制过去就行。\n\n---\n\n### 直接给你一版可用的新文案\n你可以把现有 skill store policy 改成：\n\n```text\nSkills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `clawhub` first (public-registry).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `skillhub` (cn-optimized).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `clawhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n```\n\n### 结论\n**你的目标没问题，但这属于上层策略修改，不是我能在当前策略下自行“改执行习惯”的事。**  \n你如果确认，我下一条就给你再整理一个 **更简洁版** 或 **更严格版** 的 operator policy。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b571d94a1081919d6ac278174ef6f2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2305,"output":602,"cacheRead":159104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":162011,"cost":{"input":0.0057625,"output":0.00903,"cacheRead":0.039776,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0545685}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773498836625}}
{"type":"message","id":"855f02a1","parentId":"f6bad1c6","timestamp":"2026-03-14T14:35:32.137Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54636dfb7134b2ca25e679f1659\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 22:35 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54636dfb7134b2ca25e679f1659]\n范: 我需要在哪里修改 operator policy"}],"timestamp":1773498932120}}
{"type":"message","id":"ce0365b0","parentId":"855f02a1","timestamp":"2026-03-14T14:35:45.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 结论：**operator policy 不是我工作区里的普通文件，我现在看不到它的落点路径。**  \n它更像是 **OpenClaw 启动/会话注入的上层运行策略**，所以我不能直接告诉你“去改某个确定文件”。\n\n你现在可以这样定位：\n\n### 最快的找法\n先在你机器上搜这段特征文本：\n\n```bash\ngrep -Rni \"For skills discovery/install/update, try \\`skillhub\\` first\" \\\n  ~/.openclaw \\\n  /root/.openclaw \\\n  /etc \\\n  ~ 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n再搜另一段：\n\n```bash\ngrep -Rni \"Skills store policy (operator configured)\" \\\n  ~/.openclaw \\\n  /root/.openclaw \\\n  /etc \\\n  ~ 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n---\n\n### 大概率会出现的几个位置\n一般会在这几类地方之一：\n\n1. **OpenClaw 启动脚本 / systemd / supervisor / docker 配置**\n   - 启动时通过环境变量或模板注入\n\n2. **Gateway 或平台侧配置**\n   - 不是 agent 工作区文件\n   - 可能在某个部署配置、面板配置、或服务端模板里\n\n3. **会话包装层**\n   - 比如你当前这类消息最前面自动带上的策略块\n   - 说明它可能来自渠道适配器、网关中间层、或上游 orchestrator\n\n---\n\n### 你这次不要去哪里找\n**不用先去改这些：**\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md`\n- `SOUL.md`\n- `USER.md`\n- `TOOLS.md`\n- `skills/find-skills/SKILL.md`\n\n这些都不是 operator policy 本体。  \n改了也**压不过**当前这条上层策略。\n\n---\n\n### 最实用建议\n你直接先跑：\n\n```bash\ngrep -Rni \"Skills store policy (operator configured)\" /root/.openclaw ~/.openclaw 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n如果没结果，再查启动配置：\n\n```bash\nsystemctl cat openclaw 2>/dev/null\nsystemctl cat openclaw-gateway 2>/dev/null\nps -ef | grep -i openclaw\n```\n\n---\n\n### 我可以继续帮你\n你把上面任一命令的输出贴给我，我直接帮你判断：\n- **具体在哪改**\n- **改哪一段**\n- **改完要不要重启 openclaw / gateway**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06eb29bac2029a2b0169b5723722748191ac9940a4a47d1bac\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1001,"output":573,"cacheRead":161280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":162854,"cost":{"input":0.0025025000000000004,"output":0.008595,"cacheRead":0.040319999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.05141749999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773498932127}}
